---
description: Require every agent session to read AGENTS.md before modifying the repo
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

Before modifying any file in this repository, read `AGENTS.md` at the repository
root and follow it. It is the permanent engineering contract: generated code is
read-only, handwritten code stays minimal, configuration must reach the wire,
and claims require verification.
